This product includes techniques and reflection patterns for calling hidden
Android audio-policy APIs from a shell-privileged process, adapted from:

  scrcpy — https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Specifically the ActivityThread / FakeContext bootstrap and the
  AudioPolicy/AudioMix registration approach.

This product depends on, but does not include, the following at build time:
  - ONNX Runtime (MIT) — https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
  - Shizuku API (Apache-2.0 / MIT) — https://github.com/RikkaApps/Shizuku-API
  - AndroidX / Jetpack Compose (Apache-2.0)
